data: {"delta":"Based on the retrieved evidence, here are NVIDIA's most recent announcements with their dates:\n\n1. NVIDIA and Meta to Expand Collaboration on Muse (October 27, 2026) [2]\n   - This announcement, made 7 days ago according to the source, details the expanded collaboration between NVIDIA and Meta on the Muse family of models amid robust growth.\n\n2. NVIDIA Marketplace - Official NVIDIA Store for Data Center (November 2, 2026) [3]\n   - This is the most recent announcement, made 3 hours ago according to the source, regarding the official NVIDIA Store for Data Center.\n\n3. NVIDIA and Supply Chain Partners Expand Capacity to Accelerate AI Infrastructure Buildout (October 21, 2026) [1]\n   - This announcement details new capacity agreements and manufacturing facilities to support volume growth and strengthen supply chain resiliency, which will drive a 2.5x increase in capacity over the current levels.","conversationId":"cmw01hsps001cqareimgqsdy9"}

